# Generalization Proof Addition
cmca:LensGeneralizationProof a cmca:Lens .
cmca:LensGeneralizationProof cmca:lensExponent "1.5"^^xsd:decimal .

cmca:MeasureGeneralizationProof a cmca:MeasureHead .

cmca:Lambda_GP_0 a cmca:LambdaCoefficient .
cmca:Lambda_GP_0 cmca:measure cmca:MeasureGeneralizationProof .
cmca:Lambda_GP_0 cmca:lens cmca:LensGeneralizationProof .
cmca:Lambda_GP_0 cmca:value "0.9"^^xsd:decimal .

cmca:Obj_GeneralizationProof a cmca:SemanticObject .
cmca:Obj_GeneralizationProof cmca:recomputationCost "0.1"^^xsd:decimal .
cmca:Obj_GeneralizationProof cmca:verificationCost "0.2"^^xsd:decimal .
cmca:Obj_GeneralizationProof cmca:standing "0.3"^^xsd:decimal .
cmca:Obj_GeneralizationProof cmca:validity "0.4"^^xsd:decimal .
cmca:Obj_GeneralizationProof cmca:accessFrequency "0.5"^^xsd:decimal .
cmca:Obj_GeneralizationProof cmca:searchDemand "0.6"^^xsd:decimal .
cmca:Obj_GeneralizationProof cmca:retrievalDemand "0.7"^^xsd:decimal .
cmca:Obj_GeneralizationProof cmca:schedulingDemand "0.8"^^xsd:decimal .
cmca:Obj_GeneralizationProof cmca:businessValue "50.0"^^xsd:decimal .
